 "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZIV5QZnQ3IQ7kNvwE8HS5s&_nc_oc=AdonKonM3pou3J8fgz2Vmh1IxRkLjSq74tnrBRPRKvRfoSa5k4Fq8v9KQV1WFBz7kqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1RUaCO9RNtSJ2D7sip3BNxspgQBSeXUsaWot55mGgz5w&oe=69D7BB24"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M1MO3r9pe-sQ7kNvwEvwznP&_nc_oc=Adpzgc1PuDqwvnb-eDR9qumLDlp4eze9rmzR33_E0RLoIGPZIyTVLzbNyhFNZHzkltw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0GW9-mTS2-5eX8NuuycSM7xZne2kBCIm-qAxEV7T1dGg&oe=69D79EAC"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gNs7bsiHbjAQ7kNvwGB54z8&_nc_oc=AdqKI8LWYt_TSAUEYAjYJL_OEAVybGGfVp4l-DZ0ACG1pEo_BO5offnuVXwSMgeOEuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2-6_fi874_0o1osjZ2i1HMxO9GkWHLzzPuRGSF3TIruw&oe=69D79D9C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dZbC-CnW6XMQ7kNvwEjulEe&_nc_oc=AdpqmwetwA1wKFqqP90v_MgCzeL8dntmJO_vK4VBn_UJAkaZ6g4tf2QwBPZQHe276Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Cizk4RGyPhIJ4iSXKXzaK-cBN81n5qB7mQuB4a9e25A&oe=69D7911D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zC69sMqIhngQ7kNvwE2oBR7&_nc_oc=AdpflVuFKa6YIrEdgpygSZ2nRq5yfwmZrV_L8OqdLq8GDW_-Jn2GD4KGVrzg60brHnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af04We7F57oEdOKQGXtnGJYd99rC3a7VNe2RwfK04XvzvQ&oe=69D7964F"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "dev